      "description": "Full Trip Planning (GHS 2,000)\nFull destination research and itinerary design \nFlight research and booking (up to 2 destinations)\nHotel research and booking (up to 2 destinations) \nActivities and experiences researched and booked \nTransfers and ground transport arranged \nBudget breakdown and travel fund request \nOne minor revision included, GHS 150 each additional\nTravel Pack PDF delivered on completion \nPremium Concierge Planning (GHS 3,000)\nFor clients who want to hand everything over completely. Everything in Full Trip Planning \nPLUS:\nUp to 4 destinations\nPriority handling — planning begins within 2 working days of deposit\nActive WhatsApp support throughout the trip — daily check-ins included\nRestaurant reservations included (up to 3)\nOne special occasion arrangement included (birthday, anniversary, proposal)\nUnlimited minor revisions\nPremium Travel Pack — custom cover, personalised destination notes",
